Input: {"question": "Who is the artist of the album \"Both Sides Now\"?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d00", "start": 0, "end": 112, "text": "Both Sides Now (Marina Prior album) Both Sides Now is the fourth studio album by Australian singer Marina Prior."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d00", "start": 113, "end": 206, "text": "It is her first studio album since \"Somewhere – The Songs of Sondheim and Bernstein\" in 1994."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d00", "start": 207, "end": 301, "text": "She says the main reason for taking so long since her last album was that she was simply busy."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d00", "start": 302, "end": 383, "text": "“The thing is because I work in theatre it is all encompassing and all consuming."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d00", "start": 384, "end": 469, "text": "You do eight shows a week and for quite a few years I went from show to show to show."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d00", "start": 470, "end": 508, "text": "I wasn’t in a position to do an album."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d00", "start": 509, "end": 510, "text": "I"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d01", "start": 0, "end": 105, "text": "Both Sides Now (Elton John album) Both Sides Now is the fourth studio album by British singer Elton John."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d01", "start": 106, "end": 199, "text": "It is his first studio album since \"Somewhere – The Songs of Sondheim and Bernstein\" in 1994."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0346-946054965a81:d01", "start": 200, "end": 292, "text": "He says the main reason for taking so long since his last album was that he wa